**Findings**
- **Tariffs:** IEEPA duties ended Feb 24, 2026 and the Section 122 surcharge expired Jul 24. China goods now pay MFN plus Section 301 (25% on Lists 1–3, 7.5% on List 4A) plus a 12.5% forced-labor tariff. I used 0.375 for Lists 1–3 goods and 0.20 for List 4A goods. I couldn't confirm which list covers cosmetics, toys or skates, so those rates are labeled as guesses.
- **Exclusions:** The 178 Section 301 exclusions were due to expire Nov 9. I found no extension.
- **Trend sources:** I took the trend leads from Exploding Topics and Google's Holiday 100. Amazon Movers & Shakers and Reddit returned nothing usable. TikTok Creative Center gave only secondhand guides, and I found no TikTok Shop November 2026 ranking.
- **Last week's top three:** I kept the hypochlorous acid spray, nHA toothpaste and peptide eye cream and re-checked them. I changed no inputs, since no better supplier quotes turned up.
- **New candidates:** under-eye patches, PDRN serum, kojic acid serum, lymphatic face brush kit, batana mask, tallow balm, toe spacers, creatine gummies, kids' roller skates, wooden train set, scent beads, hair wax stick, brow gel kit, magnetic spice rack and dog stroller.
- **Kills:** acne-claim microneedle patches, because the FDA has authorized none for over-the-counter sale, and "GLP-1" supplements. The GLP-1 kill rests on my judgment, not a source I opened, and the notes say so.

**Weak spots**
- Unit costs for the skincare items and most home goods are my estimates, because suppliers publish no per-unit quotes. Each is flagged in `notes`.
- The electronics and home items carried over from last week, such as the label printer, monitor and rice cooker, were not re-verified.
- The competition and complaint scores are my judgment. I had no Amazon review counts.
- Several of the new items price under $40, including the batana mask, toe spacers and hair wax stick. They are included with honest numbers, so the scoring screen may drop them.
- I dropped last week's cordless vacuum, litter box, neck massager, mini projector, water filter, padel set and collagen powder. I found no new evidence for them.

